OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FMark Forrest showcases superb
OL,12,     Fperformances the UK and beyond,
OL,13,     Fincluding a live concert from
OL,14,     Fpianist Barry Douglas at Wigmore
OL,15,     FHall, featuring music by Brahms
OL,16,     Fand Mussorgsky.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Greatest
OL,18,G     Showstoppers
OL,19,     F1/4. Donald Macleod explores the
OL,20,     Flife and music of the 'Valkyrie of
OL,21,     Fthe Piano', Teresa Carreno.
