OL,5,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,6,     FThis week Soweto marks the
OL,7,     Fcentenary of one the most
OL,8,     Finfluential figures in jazz, John
OL,9,     FColtrane. He is joined by guests
OL,10,     Falong the way, starting with
OL,11,     Fsaxophonist Isaiah Collier.
OL,12,G0030 Through the Night
OL,13,     FSollazzo Ensemble and Anna
OL,14,     FDanilevskaia directing from the
OL,15,     Ffiddle, perform Franco-Flemish
OL,16,     Fmusic of the 15th Century from the
OL,17,     FMusica Antiqua Festival in Bruges.
